IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `sgunca-sales`

-- Sale of Goods (United Nations Convention) Act 1995, s 3 and Schedule Arts 1 to 6, 14, 16, 19, 25, 39, 40, 44, 46, 49, 50, 75 to 77, 79, 82 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_sale-of-goods-united-nations-convention-act-1995.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

`a Singapore importer buying lathes from a German maker` MEANS Sale WITH
