    `fixes or provides for the quantity` IS TRUE
    `fixes or provides for the price` IS TRUE
    `shows intention to be bound` IS TRUE

`a price catalogue mailed to the trade` MEANS Proposal WITH
    `addressed to specific persons` IS FALSE
