`a buyer of goods with a fundamental defect who acts promptly` MEANS `Buyer's position` WITH
    `the seller's breach is fundamental` IS TRUE
    `the goods were delivered` IS TRUE
    `the buyer's additional period expired without delivery` IS FALSE
    `the seller said it would not deliver in that period` IS FALSE
    `the buyer acted within a reasonable time` IS TRUE
    `the buyer can return the goods substantially as received` IS TRUE
    `the impossibility is not the buyer's doing` IS FALSE
    `the goods deteriorated through examination` IS FALSE
    `the goods were resold or used up before the defect was discoverable` IS FALSE

`a buyer still without the goods after the additional period` MEANS `Buyer's position` WITH
    `the seller's breach is fundamental` IS FALSE
    `the goods were delivered` IS FALSE
    `the buyer's additional period expired without delivery` IS TRUE
    `the seller said it would not deliver in that period` IS FALSE
    `the buyer acted within a reasonable time` IS FALSE
    `the buyer can return the goods substantially as received` IS TRUE
    `the impossibility is not the buyer's doing` IS FALSE
    `the goods deteriorated through examination` IS FALSE
    `the goods were resold or used up before the defect was discoverable` IS FALSE

`a buyer facing a minor defect` MEANS `Buyer's position` WITH
    `the seller's breach is fundamental` IS FALSE
    `the goods were delivered` IS TRUE
    `the buyer's additional period expired without delivery` IS FALSE
    `the seller said it would not deliver in that period` IS FALSE
    `the buyer acted within a reasonable time` IS TRUE
